// One triangle of the loaded mesh.
//
// The colour is the engine's default clay. Per-face material colour is in the
// file and not wired up yet; what makes the geometry readable in the meantime is
// bl_lit's directional term, not the colour.

ed_mtri(int[] tri, int i) {
  bl_lit(i, tri, 0xB9A38A);
} return void;
